dad83-db0e-11ef-9891-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平邑縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"平邑县","start_index":94,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad84-db0e-11ef-b966-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平湖","place_name_jianti_auto":"平湖","start_index":101,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad85-db0e-11ef-b471-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平湖","place_name_jianti_auto":"平湖","start_index":109,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad86-db0e-11ef-80d0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"高柳","place_name_jianti_auto":"高柳","start_index":113,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad87-db0e-11ef-b78d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"代郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"代郡","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad88-db0e-11ef-bce7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"道人縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"道人县","start_index":128,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad89-db0e-11ef-b609-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平湖","place_name_jianti_auto":"平湖","start_index":144,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad8a-db0e-11ef-8c1e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平陰","place_name_jianti_auto":"平阴","place_note":"山西阳高东南","start_index":147,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad8b-db0e-11ef-98e5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"史記正義曰：樂徐在晉州，平陰在汾州。余謂上書代地震，則樂徐、平陰皆代地也，烏得在晉、汾二州界！水經註：徐水出代郡廣昌縣東南大嶺下，東北流，逕郞山入北平郡界。意樂徐之地，當在徐水左右。又代郡平邑縣，王莽曰平湖。十三州志：平湖城在高柳南百八十里。水經註曰：代郡道人縣城北有潭，淵而不注，俗謂之平湖。平陰之地，蓋在此湖之陰也。樂，意當音落。","note_content_jianti_auto":"史记正义曰：乐徐在晋州，平阴在汾州。余谓上书代地震，则乐徐、平阴皆代地也，乌得在晋、汾二州界！水经注：徐水出代郡广昌县东南大岭下，东北流，迳郞山入北平郡界。意乐徐之地，当在徐水左右。又代郡平邑县，王莽曰平湖。十三州志：平湖城在高柳南百八十里。水经注曰：代郡道人县城北有潭，渊而不注，俗谓之平湖。平阴之地，盖在此湖之阴也。乐，意当音落。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad70-db0e-11ef-9603-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"毛晃","people_name_jianti_auto":"毛晃","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad91-db0e-11ef-8528-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"毛晃曰：四方而高曰臺。垣，于元翻。坼，斥格翻；說文：裂也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"毛晃曰：四方而高曰台。垣，于元翻。坼，斥格翻；说文：裂也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad90-db0e-11ef-9f23-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8d4dad6f-db0e-11ef-913b-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"chè","source_anchor_text":"太半壞地坼東西百三","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":25,"text":"坼","tongjian_id":"e6e9ee54-396e-5bfe-adc8-7328fab832f8"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"代","place_name_jianti_auto":"代","place_note":"河北蔚縣","resolved_place_entity_id":239,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad93-db0e-11ef-90bc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"樂徐","place_name_jianti_auto":"乐徐","place_note":"河北涞源东南","resolved_place_entity_id":7564,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad94-db0e-11ef-b900-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平陰","place_name_jianti_auto":"平阴","place_note":"山西阳高东南","resolved_place_entity_id":2275,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad95-db0e-11ef-9777-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/八、大同府（卷四十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"胡氏曰：乐徐当在徐水左右，平阴见下灵丘县。○唐河，在县南...","context_before":"...下，东北流径郎山，入北平县界，即今直隶保定府徐河上源也。","source_end_index":78,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"6c5861db-3dae-59d5-b3b6-33d625049c2e","source_start_index":54,"source_text":"《秦纪》：始皇十六年，代地震，自乐徐以北至平阴。"},{"context_after":"平阴当在平湖之北也。又阳原城，在县东北，汉县，属代郡。《...","context_before":"...，属代郡。《水经注》：道人县有潭，渊而不流，俗谓之平湖。","source_end_index":136,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"ae6b0f69-70d7-575c-bb63-fb9cffb2e474","source_start_index":115,"source_text":"战国赵王迁五年，代地震，自乐齐以北至平阴。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/八、大同府（卷四十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"3代地震，自樂徐以西，北至平陰，臺屋牆垣太半壞，地坼東西百三十步。","content_fanyi":"代地发生地震，从乐徐向西，北到平阴，高台、房屋、墙垣大半毁坏，地面裂开一条东西长一百三十步的裂缝。","content_jianti_auto":"3代地震，自乐徐以西，北至平阴，台屋墙垣太半坏，地坼东西百三十步。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":517,"number":3,"re